-- CDM-27949 - Issue Still Persists with LAP
/*
-- Issue Description:

   CPS-AR : 221020236692

   The answer to this question on the 'DOMESTIC VIOLENCE LETHALITY SCREEN' assessment 
   "If victim is High-Danger, did the practitioner make a call to the hotline?" should reflect "Yes". 
   The system keeps defaulting the answer to "No". A data fix must be done to change the answer to reflect "Yes" on this approved assessment. 
   The issue of the answer to this question defaulting to "No" when saved is not case specific. 
*/

